{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026sPryaLacgm1795141822.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>人民幣中間價連跌兩天。</p><p></p><p>官方開出的人民幣中間價，報6.7131，較上個交易日下調3點子。現貨人民幣方面，在岸價早段於6.68水平上落，離岸價於6.67徘徊。另外人民銀行開展3,795億元人民幣隔夜逆回購操作，扣除今日到期的逆回購，單日在市場淨回籠6,880億元人民幣。全周計算，淨回籠2,845億元人民幣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T03:44:12.012806+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T02:29:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T08:17:22.891855+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T03:37:19.702623+00:00","content_hash":"6f43142726d5605179e4fed1702b0df1f0dfce85ad2ea9729b3a0509941e79ce","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}